### Colección de pruebas — requiere la extensión "REST Client" de VS Code
### Ejecuta las peticiones en orden (clic en "Send Request").
@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### 0. Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### 1. Crear autor
# @name createAuthor
POST {{base}}/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Gabriel García Márquez", "nationality": "Colombiana", "birthYear": 1927 }

###
@authorId = {{createAuthor.response.body._id}}

### 2. Listar autores (paginado)
GET {{base}}/authors?page=1&limit=10

### 3. Consultar autor
GET {{base}}/authors/{{authorId}}

### 4. Actualizar autor
PUT {{base}}/authors/{{authorId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nationality": "Colombiana (Nobel)" }

### 5. Crear libro
# @name createBook
POST {{base}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Cien años de soledad", "isbn": "978-0307474728", "authorId": "{{authorId}}", "year": 1967 }

###
@bookId = {{createBook.response.body._id}}

### 6. Listar libros disponibles
GET {{base}}/books?available=true

### 7. Libros de un autor (extra)
GET {{base}}/authors/{{authorId}}/books

### 8. Consultar / actualizar libro
GET {{base}}/books/{{bookId}}

###
PUT {{base}}/books/{{bookId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "year": 1967 }

### 9. Registrar préstamo (el libro pasa a available:false)
# @name createLoan
POST {{base}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookId": "{{bookId}}", "userName": "Ana Pérez", "loanDate": "2025-05-20" }

###
@loanId = {{createLoan.response.body._id}}

### 10. Repetir el préstamo del mismo libro -> 409 (no disponible)
POST {{base}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookId": "{{bookId}}", "userName": "Luis Gómez", "loanDate": "2025-05-21" }

### 11. Listar préstamos / activos (extra)
GET {{base}}/loans

###
GET {{base}}/loans/active

### 12. Eliminar autor con libros -> 409
DELETE {{base}}/authors/{{authorId}}

### 13. Devolver el libro (asigna returnDate y libera el libro)
PUT {{base}}/loans/{{loanId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "returned": true }

### 14. Errores esperados
# 400: id inválido
GET {{base}}/books/abc

###
# 400: campo obligatorio faltante
POST {{base}}/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "" }

###
# 404: autor inexistente
POST {{base}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "X", "isbn": "111-222", "authorId": "000000000000000000000000" }

### 15. Eliminar (en orden: préstamo -> libro -> autor)
DELETE {{base}}/loans/{{loanId}}

###
DELETE {{base}}/books/{{bookId}}

###
DELETE {{base}}/authors/{{authorId}}
